  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 14th level, the courser is unburdened by physical exhaustion. The courser needs to only sleep 1 hour per day to gain the benefits of 8 hours of sleep, and does not need to eat or drink to survive, nor do they suffer any penalties for dehydration or starvation. This does not allow the courser to prepare spells or recover daily resources more than once per day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/courser#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
